x1019 text "The slowest test program is 4.31x slower on mat4 against baselines with the same calling convention, and 7.58x slower on mat4 against each language's own inlined driver. Same calling convention (A0 and the best of C, Rust and Zig, both called out of line): 2 wins, 9 ties, 8 losses of 19. Inlined drivers: 2 wins, 9 ties, 8 losses. Against hand-written C alone, A0 takes 1.16x as long, a geometric mean over the test programs; 1.00x would be equal."
